    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the client's requirements, including the need to implement an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to agents, improve efficiency and quality of service, reduce complexity of procedures, centralize sources of information, automate processing of requests, and ensure continuity of file processing between agents and services, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience in managing public sector projects." ;
