    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Among Nexus Engineering S.r.l. certified methodologies, PRINCE2 stands out as a suitable choice due to PRINCE2 emphasis on business case-driven project management, which aligns well with the client's needs for efficiency, quality, and cost-effectiveness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, considering the average project duration in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is 18 months and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have available project management capacity, adopting an iterative approach within the PRINCE2 framework could accommodate the evolving nature of artificial intelligence solutions and the need for continuous improvement. an iterative approach allows for flexibility while maintaining a structured approach to project governance, risk management, and quality control, which are essential given the client's requirements for high availability, security, and compliance with regulatory constraints." ;
