        ex:hasText "Given Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s legal standing and procurement experience across the European Union jurisdictions, what are the main contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project, and how can Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s mitigate the main contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project through Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s proposed solution?" ;
