        ex:hasText "Given Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s experience in public procurement across the European Union jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and the European Union institutions, Nexus Engineering S.r.l.'s are well-equipped to handle the main contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project. the main contractual and regulatory risks associated with this project are related to GDPR compliance, data protection, and adherence to regulatory requirements." ;
